        "140018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8d0ed1e6c950cac1699b8486",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "明日はこれだってさ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e0ffffb4262048c0ee5fe5599b24b66b2b29bb04ca72a5a8e163f8d1d0c70d9c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "15"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e0cdf4fcdda96f57b03084c7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "結構バテバテなんだよん。\r\nブーブー。トレーニングはんたーい\r\nウマ娘に休みをー、ウチに自由をー",
      "source_fingerprint": "c268505e2570ce7affd3b99d83d2fde0436a85b3d2113a3641c6cf4614e61137",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "20000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9ab83cac49b2cd5d2f44df8e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "あ…これ知ってる。\r\n無理したらヤバイやつだ～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a49602d62c3c689987bef36d20fbc524d1e317719dba6897c1dabd47992ac984",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "20001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a70d5eab1779670e83ecbb30",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "『朗報・トランセンドは絶好調！』\r\nってね～。ほらほら、\r\nとにかくいろいろ試そーよ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b35a0a93e559d5f49e8f5b82ecb110946c455ff8bcd4f67e71da2f852bdd0753",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "20002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7578c94edc3e0d394975db7e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ねね、今日はさー、\r\n新しいことしたいな～。\r\n今なら何でも取り込めそう！",
      "source_fingerprint": "53c70af66bfb0a6c289e29ffc877180cb4ed06183dbd7a5a00a983ea17b4713e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "20003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0616c5886ab06c157a60933a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "もち、準備万全だよん。\r\nトレちゃんの考えてるメニューも\r\n把握済みってね。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cc685d334039cf6adb93ce29eef5530da9cfe606263fb609c5014964cfda1442",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "20004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b253ed61f6cd70f2fd1f0f4e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今のバイオリズムなら\r\nそこそこ、うまくいきそう。\r\n正確な情報だから安心して～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1297831f7229bd553ba992a3f51ed39dcef047caf6eff749265d0dd308422323",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "20005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4f2d03046891fd51e7180e89",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "うし。情報もまとめたし、\r\nぼちぼちやろっか。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f1ead5dd0b3d76ebdf6ce2580f5495bb56f31863d5cab19da3aa83fb9af2d042",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "20006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:62195d390558cff4b15f792b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "トレーニング、何する～？\r\nなるべく面白いヤツに1票ね。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b26cc17246f9c92629b64e6a64eb9cf57b37d8ad29672226f46affeb5638ae90",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "20007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:168345b6b0ac0c51d841a8e6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "仕入れた情報、メモってないな…\r\nいや、ダルいし後にしよ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "30b23c084bb9874ee757b582b69ea660a6fca3fa38d8b189581d7035b0ca4f12",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "20008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:091f7e453a65e61856fae016",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "コースに特ダネ落ちてないかな～？\r\nそれなら頑張れるかも…\r\n頑張れないかも。",
      "source_fingerprint": "44a7220f0fa7309c1daa12c923112138e6d1a3fff509f54982382961dae6462d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "20009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3908fbfa3056550b3e40994e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "うーーん、やる気の上げ方\r\n募集したんだけど…。\r\nダメだ、有力情報なしっぽい。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b7dcf51422aa4f4614109152256652e716258337736abc7cfa326ad308b4d88f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "20010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:144be78c4a48779f2b85ee32",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "あー…SFの世界だったらな～。\r\n調子を上げてくれる\r\nアプリとかありそうじゃん…？",
      "source_fingerprint": "fb71f5ac1a09e9b842f4deb26c7eb0e68bed48b8442ce4a2f07178b0dd14f219",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "20011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:52d95153895792df35dbf0e7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "いやいや、走らせ過ぎ…。\r\nゾクゾクする前に、\r\nヘトヘトなんだけど～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ef978a95e95fb5571a1a4f9c049ad16ac0f3dd281e53c227e3ac51b6c4d3008a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "20021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3c714d33334a326c3ffaae9f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "またレース？マジか～。\r\n限界だよ…終わったら、\r\nちゃんと話そ。1回、真剣にさ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b63fffecc7070822b174cd641fba0a26119fb89ac98bed6b2d5444da924df0bc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "20022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ee15d7f051f1db2a508c4621",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "みんなゾクゾクさせてくれそう…\r\nへへへ、待ちきれないね～。\r\n隅々まで味わっちゃうよん♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "a939cdb4a66e68db0b0d38e77482dfb27af3cfc88e60f7193d80028e8589c6c5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "20023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b06b892ecdbb0a4c553920c3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "期待しててよね～？\r\n『トランセンド1着』って情報、\r\nすぐ広まるはずだよん。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6a58d878a552a4f5c843e9914926dc1ec97b8d8cdf5a3cbdb0513fa4ebcf6fe3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "20024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:44c6467063b66b55ca5ae283",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "気分いいから、\r\nカメラ目線で走っちゃおっかな～？\r\n新感覚楽しめそうじゃんね。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f50c75c407aae113a8d1efb117ae6609b0d9ab0923749b1325ba71605b65f745",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "20025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:03bd9f4a629355c678e0fc60",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "バチバチの競り合いとか\r\n激やば展開起きないかな？\r\nあはっ、高まるね～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "051532c3c8d3b26acaa7581e65cb5f60b01b8d5316ca7c5abeeaf482a36947b1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "20026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e18d8c09e6b6d8a2f6218acf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "いい仕上がりになったよん。\r\nウチの情報、使いこなせてるね～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1591cf12f97cfde6d75532d2be8b021dd2dcb405eea43e01242fcac8d7b2c4ce",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "20027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:72b75b675b70028172a434ec",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情報通り、み～んな仕上げて\r\nきてるねぇ。…んでまあ、ウチらは\r\nその上をいっちゃいましょーってね",
      "source_fingerprint": "eca777a4e57c26e65b4aeee8184b00878b55afa27ec601df5cdd70e029d18d71",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "20028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5035e898249169283406804d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "うし、必要な情報はまとまったかな\r\nあとは本番で、どう使うか――",
      "source_fingerprint": "1b93143d93d0b254ab1fdccb2882568c080963ae2b4ddd33b443a5772c0eca60",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "20029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a60bb64bb1fe0e2fc9331e9f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ウチならいつも通りだけど…お、\r\nあっちの子、前と雰囲気違うね。\r\nチェックチェック～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2acd689ae423684738c883be813868ff019f22e6293697b12741910f39a0f723",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "20030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c365bce2dedc540b5ca2627b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "めいっぱい楽しんでくるよん。\r\nそれが1番大事じゃん？",
      "source_fingerprint": "434b19721756f8e885d96fa68383ecc1184a206a087ba02924e4a3178984fee4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "20031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7f9e5dfde74374f8a598b7f3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "んー…走り出したら\r\n気分も変わんのかな～。\r\nま、期待しすぎないでおこ…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "39f058060e6b5553201fd79385d7eea131c8089737953895e66722a0dd6bc300",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "20032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:157c10e469f439bacdb30523",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "んー、イマイチしまらないな～。\r\n調子の悪さは、\r\n情報で補うしかないかも…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bfe3abf2e7314bc7283b758a37b9839d7effc8bfd56e93c777a112309332f8c5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "20033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1afb07b200712ec2b9443917",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "やっぱ調子上がんないな…。\r\nばっちり糖分補給したのに～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9be5d977476f850342794c726a238854b660f8153563d6e0e36e039d29f2def7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "20034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:db3eceb00905657ca0eaa415",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "こんな状態で走るって、\r\nある意味未知のレースか～。\r\nそれを楽しめるといいけど…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9fe55494e0ad1c28049aecf0eb1874310b260dcccd6d94f04b6ec50b9364ba71",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "20035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6e286d14ece2814842d9f83f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "他所のいい情報が耳に痛いや…。\r\nはぁ…今は何も聞かずに集中～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d5eff0d8d24c32336fa784d04c6e11ecfe65a8d812f8e075dfeaf875748e8a0d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "20036"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ac69c897c7a51e460e9d561e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "タブレットのカタログ読んでも\r\nテンション上がんない～。\r\nガチ重症だなこりゃ…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9ad538ad1f283ea614be5044148fbb46b428406bf04bdad755bac7f0090e11d2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "20037"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:578d4df7cb01cd474c40258f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "さて。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4ccc0a4c1d8553a1216b70a22cc2817117c30e5db50980ed67df860ae5ad58f0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "20038"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:84d89e4ea37b53bdd0b560e7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "いくよん。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f7bd14fb134e57c1662a098cf82370338a9d93079ae0206650ff710129fc96a2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "20039"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
